chrischall/vibo-mcp  1.2.0 -> 1.3.0
change_type: instructions   changelog: vibo-mcp 1.3.0  - Added support for single sign-on (SSO) authentication via browser capture, using the fetchproxy extension and new vibo_capture_session tool. - Updated authentication docs in SKILL.md to include SSO/browser capture options. - Documented new tool: vibo_capture_session. - Removed skill-card.md file.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
+ - **Browser capture (SSO, automatic):** with the fetchproxy browser extension
+   installed and yourself signed into https://web.vibodj.com, run
+   `vibo_capture_session` once — it grabs the token from your tab (approve the
+   pair code), saves it to `~/.vibo-mcp/session.json`, and reuses it thereafter.
+ - `vibo_capture_session` — capture your login from a signed-in browser tab (SSO accounts).